# Whitelist Configuration File
# ----------------------------
# This file contains the list of usernames allowed to register.
#
# Format:
# - One username per line
# - Lines starting with # are comments (ignored)
# - Empty lines are ignored
# - Usernames are case-sensitive (e.g., "bob", "Bob", and "BOB" are different)
#
# The whitelist file is automatically reloaded when changed without requiring
# a server restart. Simply edit this file and save.
#
# Example users:
# alice
# bob
# charlie
#
# Add your usernames below:
